{"slug":"news/child-safety-principles","title":"Aligning on child safety principles \\ Anthropic","desc":"Alongside other leading AI companies, we're committed to robust child safety measures in the development and deployment of generative AI.","main":"<div class=\"\"><article class=\"EaEYjq_Article\" style=\"opacity:1\"><header class=\"VYxBBq_Header\" style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"VYxBBq_Content\"><h1 class=\"VYxBBq_Title\">Aligning on child safety principles</h1></div><div class=\"VYxBBq_MetalistContainer\" style=\"--metalist-columns:3\"><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Metalist\"><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Published</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><time datetime=\"2024-04-23\">Apr 23, 2024</time></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Category</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" href=\"/news/policy\">Policy</a></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Topics</p><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Wrap\"><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=limits-on-abuse\">Limits on abuse</a></li><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=safeguards\">Safeguards</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_ThirdTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=partnerships\">Partnerships</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_HiddenTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=red-teaming\">Red teaming</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_HiddenTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=race-to-the-top\">Race to the top</a></li></ul><button class=\"VYxBBq_TopicSeeMore text-caption-1\">See more...</button></li></ul></div></header><div class=\"EaEYjq_ContentWrapper\"><div class=\"EaEYjq_ConstellationPanelSlot\"><aside style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: tr